  - "alpha-stable distributions"
  - "predictive uncertainty"
  - "global sensitivity analysis"
  - "irrigated rice"

abstract: >-
  Reproducibility repository for the SERRA stochastic modelling framework.
  The repository contains R code, aggregated field observations, model inputs,
  cached numerical results, and supporting material for calibration,
  Monte Carlo prediction, Leave-One-Out cross-validation, Sobol global
  sensitivity analysis, robustness assessment, and complementary numerical
  diagnostics.